OL,5,G1850 Car S.O.S
OL,6,     FFord Escort Mexico: Tim and Fuzz
OL,7,     Ftravel to Jersey to fix up Gary's
OL,8,     F1972 Mark I Escort Mexico. His
OL,9,     Fdream of owning a showstopper was
OL,10,     Fshattered when he was diagnosed
OL,11,     Fwith leukaemia.
OL,12,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FDesign engineer Mark, who has
OL,14,     Fparalysis from the waist down,
OL,15,     Fplans to build a cutting-edge,
OL,16,     Faccessible family home for #600k.
OL,17,     FBut it's a huge emotional strain
OL,18,     Ffor him and his wife Penny.
